{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27789","headline":"句 · 张祜","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万国见清道，一身成白头。\n此地荣辱盛，岂宜山中人。\n椿儿遶树春园里，桂子寻花夜月中。\n一身扶杖二儿随。\n夏雨莲苞破，秋风桂子雕。\n杜鹃花发杜鹃叫，乌臼花生乌臼啼。\n茶风无奈笔，酒秃不胜簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}